title: openWB: PV inverter
agents: openwb
catalog: hw/other
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check monitors an individual PV inverter reported by an openWB
 wallbox controller. It reports fault state, current generation power
 and today's/this month's/this year's yield.

 Data is collected via the special agent {agent_openwb}, which polls the
 read-only openWB simpleAPI HTTP endpoint
 ({/openWB/simpleAPI/simpleapi.php}) and auto-discovers configured PV
 inverters by probing a range of numeric IDs.

item:
 The PV inverter ID as reported by the openWB simpleAPI.

discovery:
 One service is created per PV inverter ID that the agent discovers.

params:
 none
